    "title": "Duke settles class-action lawsuit for $2.35 million alleging underpaid retirement benefits - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ella Moore ,\n3 hours ago Duke reached a $2.35 million settlement agreement last week in response to a 2023 class-action lawsuit filed by retired Duke Health nurse Joy Franklin, who alleged that the University had been underpaying her and other former employees’ retirement benefits. Duke had previously announced its intention to settle in January,... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
